# Normalise line endings on checkout everywhere.
#
# Windows checkouts default to core.autocrlf=true, which rewrites LF to CRLF.
# Several tests read project files and match against them, and a regex
# anchored on "\n" silently stops matching when the file arrives with "\r\n" —
# which is exactly how the docs-consistency suite failed the first time CI ran
# on Windows. Keeping the working tree LF everywhere removes the whole class.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be touched.
*.png binary
*.icns binary
*.ico binary
*.node binary
*.dmg binary
*.zip binary
